	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Ut pristini propositi perseverantiam nobis ille conferat, qui huius tam sanctissimi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>operis in utrisque classicum cecinit<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. Adagia, 3,5,88 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 848 B).</note>, quottidie precari non desino, charissime frater, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quoque magis video tenebrionum technas apricari, eo magis in orando fer<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vescit animus meus.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nec est, quod desit, qui in mediis turbis mirum in <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>modum consoletur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Carnis internitionem spiritus alimentum esse<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Kor 5,5</ref></cit>.</note> in dies <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>experior.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quo fit, ut communium adflictionum particeps<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2 Kor 1,7</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 1,9</ref></cit>.</note> fratrum adflictioni<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>bus non possim non supra modum condolere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod igitur essem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tuarum miseriarum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist wahrscheinlich die kritische Lage der Zürcher Reformation bzw. die gefährlich anwachsende Spannung während des Mandatstreites (s. unten <ref target="file10196">[Nr. 165]</ref> S. 288f, Anm. 7). <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> mag außerdem noch persönlich darunter gelitten haben, daß sein Ratschlag zu einer friedlichen Lösung in der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> vom September 1532 weitgehend auf Unverständnis stieß (vgl. oben S. 190, Anm. 8 und S. 246,2-4.</note> nuper amicorum relatione certior factus, condolui certe, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sic tamen, ut pellucentis futurae glorię Christi<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 5,2f</ref></cit>. 8,17f.</note> radios poenitius inde intro<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>spexerim, quibus recensitis - spiritus est, qui loquitur<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Siehe <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10,20</ref></cit>.</note> - eternarum divitiarum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6,20</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 12,33</ref></cit>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>acervos vidi, mox in laudes mens mea prorupit, energiam potentissimi<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>auch als</hi> praesentissimi <hi>lesbar.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>patris expendi, cuius ingenium est preter omnem humanę sapientie <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>captum in mediis turbis extremę foelicitatis nervos prodere<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Kor 2,5</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 4,4-7</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Non <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>dubito omnipotentem illum omnium rerum fotorem hactenus tuas, fratris <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>inquam, partes iuvisse, nec quod istud benefitium desuper tibi collatum<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Jak 1,17</ref></cit>.</note> sana <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>fide hactenus percensueris; sum tamen non ignarus humanarum, hoc <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>est nullarum virium, quibus «carnulentis pectoribus», ut <persName ref="p19035">Prudencii</persName> verbo utar<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p19035">Aurelius Prudentius Clemens</persName>, Peristefanon X 372 (CChr CXXVI 342).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sepe ad ima tendimus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quo fit, charissime frater, ut his meis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>litteris incepto operi calcar addere<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. Adagia, 1,2,47 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 89 B-C); <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 103, Nr. 486.</note> non verear.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Perge, perge igitur, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>consors futurae foelicitatis atque communium adflictionum particeps, noli huius <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>mundi calliditate<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Kor 1,19ff</ref></cit>. 3,19.</note><pb type="edition" next="249"/> deterreri.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ulcus Sathanę cauterium sentit, vociferatur, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>intonat, extrema minatur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">In proximo est delinquentie filium, ut <persName ref="p17746">Te<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>rtulianus</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p17746">Quintus Septimus Tertullianus</persName>, De carnis resurrectione 24 (<bibl source="b170">CSEL</bibl> XXXXVII 60).</note> loquitur, ad interitum iri.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Agit animam certe.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Interim hac <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>via sub alteri quiescentium<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Apk 6,9</ref></cit>.</note> numerus in dies adinpletur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Satis est <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>divine misericordie nos in salutem animae<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">in salutem animae <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> esse convictos, qua sic fulcimur, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut in media morte etiam preter eternam vitam sentiamus poenitus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nichil<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10,39</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 5,24f</ref></cit>. 11,25f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Consoletur te sumopere <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName><note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName> <hi>aus</hi> me <hi>korrigiert.</hi></note> tuarum erumnarum, quas ob Christi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>gloriam pateris, consortem esse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Refocillet animum tuum me in dies <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tui praecipue memorem esse apud deum in pręcibus meis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Perrumpe forti, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>hoc est fideli animo inpiorum cuneos.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">In procinctu stat dominus, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cuius presentissimo subsidio victores abituri sumus<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Kor 15,57</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">O foelices nos, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>si ob Christi gloriam periclitari contigerit<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Siehe <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 5,11</ref></cit>.</note>!</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Modo dominus adsit <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>iuxta quod pollicitus est<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Siehe <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 28,20</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Ceterum de rebus meis non est quod aures tuas <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>obtundere velim.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Posthabitis omnibus hoc unum est, quod opto, ut sese mentibus <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nostris in dies magisque deus insinuet<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Vgl. u. a. <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 2,13</ref></cit>.</note>, quo consortes [!] adflictionum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Christi ipsius vita in nobis manifestetur<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Gal 4,19</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sic transformati ad claritatem <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>corporis eius<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2 Kor 3,18</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 3,21</ref></cit>.</note> olim reviviscamus in vitam nunquam interituram<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 8,11ff</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Kol 3,1ff</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1 Petr 1,3f</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Vale, mee delicie.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Uxorem tuam<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="23"><persName ref="p8051">Anna Bullinger, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note>, parentem<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Dekan <persName ref="p20449">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>.</note> de me semper bene <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>meritum nomine meo plurimum saluta.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Ora pro me, frater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Datum <placeName ref="l28">Basilee</placeName>, 4. octobris anno sesquimillesimo tricesimo secundo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p8440">Gervasius</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, in domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>fratri charissimo meo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
